    content .= "Tab:          Tabulation - moves between fields or indents text`n"
    content .= "Caps Lock:    Toggles all letters to uppercase when typing`n"
    content .= "Num Lock:     Toggles number pad between numbers and navigation`n"
    content .= "Scroll Lock:  Rarely used legacy function, changes arrow key behavior in some programs`n"
